{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot 'em up!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your firepower by grabbing power-ups to unlock 11 weapon sets for your front and back guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies to grow and maintain your score multiplier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat food to boost your multiplier and target high-value enemies to earn extra lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems to charge your super weapon and pulverize your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the super weapon to destroy enemy bullets, earn bonus points, and escape dangerous situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the super weapon to gain temporary invincibility during the blast.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controlling Hop:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use focus mode to slow down the ship, avoid obstacles, fly through tight spaces, and dodge enemy bullets with precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Packed in:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 action-packed levels, each with a unique boss (sometimes more than one per level).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different routes to reach your goal (a fourth route will be available as a free add-on).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bonus stages designed to help you maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden warp zones to skip levels or switch routes, letting you create your own strategy for higher scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art with a comic-style presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 original music tracks composed by singer-songwriter and soundtrack composer Eden Cruz.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different final bosses.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou